  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Software distribution index",
    "overview": "The control plane pairs a slate-blue navigation rail with white work surfaces, compact controls and visible record state. Geist supplies the interface voice; borders and spacing organize tables, forms and execution evidence.\n\nThis records the implemented daytime interface. The direction is an implementation assumption documented in the surface brief, without recorded user aesthetic approval. Generated dark-mode variables exist in the stylesheet, but the application exposes no theme switch; they are outside this recorded active palette.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Slate-blue navigation and white work surfaces.",
      "Compact controls with explicit text labels and status.",
      "Tables, ruled sections and responsive detail columns.",
      "Endpoint membership shown as a live scope summary."
    ],
    "rules": [
